         "step": 1,
         "text": "A degree 3 polynomial needs the values through order 3: \\( h(1) = 0 \\), \\( h'(1) = 4 \\), \\( h''(1) = -2 \\), \\( h'''(1) = 9 \\). The value of order 4 is not used.",
         "mathjson": 9
