         "step": 2,
         "text": "Divide each by the matching factorial: \\( \\frac{0}{0!} = 0 \\), \\( \\frac{4}{1!} = 4 \\), \\( \\frac{-2}{2!} = -1 \\), \\( \\frac{9}{3!} = \\frac{3}{2} \\).",
